vive until help comes.<br>         <strong>Carnage :</strong> Kill all raptors and survive to them all ! <br><br>-<strong>Lobby fully configurable:</strong> AI or not - Number of relay - difficulty - number of enemy - maps.<br><br>-<strong>4 maps available.</strong><br><br>Join our community and find players on discord or our other social network !<br>Discord: <br>Facebook: <br>Twitter: <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509670/extras/21bb0c53863b17f1cd42c3810c2058a7.poster.avif?t=1621811059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509670/extras/21bb0c53863b17f1cd42c3810c2058a7.webm?t=1621811059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509670/extras/21bb0c53863b17f1cd42c3810c2058a7.mp4?t=1621811059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
